# Every target this project runs on is Linux (the dev box may be Windows).
# Force LF in the repo and in every checkout, regardless of a clone's local
# core.autocrlf: a CRLF shebang line fails with "No such file or directory"
# when a script is executed directly, which is exactly how the fake binaries
# and the deploy scripts are run.
* text=auto eol=lf
